silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_04_history_and_path_admission_sections_01_history_motivation_concrete_anchor_5_Animal#animal silm:hasLongDescription "The Animal is the inferred animal class; g:Mammal->Animal. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Animal', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
